      "start_seconds": 229.24,
      "end_seconds": 240.89,
      "duration_seconds": 11.65,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 100 beats a minute, respiratory rate 16, oxygen saturation is 95 percent, temperature is 38.6 degrees, BP is 119 over 77."
